{"id":"5e61d0905238a638","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md","title":"Arithmetical Hierarchy","display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy","aliases":["68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"],"display":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[68-df-natural-number]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§13 definitions and 13.1-13.2, pp.43-44 / PDF 52-53","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3368c1852f2a1aa0\" href=\"?note=3368c1852f2a1aa0\" title=\"68-df-natural-number\">68-df-natural-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§13 definitions and 13.1-13.2, pp.43-44 / PDF 52-53"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span>、一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}\\)</span> 见所列直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}\\)</span> 是下式引入的 k 元递归关系类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)},\\Pi_n^{0,(k)},\\Delta_n^{0,(k)}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)},\\Pi_n^{0,(k)},\\Delta_n^{0,(k)}\\)</span> 由 n 上的递归定义；不带元数上标的类专指一元集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow g(\\vec x)=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow g(\\vec x)=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^{0,(k)}:=\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{0,(k)}:=\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^{0,(k)}:=\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{0,(k)}:=\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^{0,(k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists R\\in\\Pi_n^{0,(k+1)}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{n+1}^{0,(k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists R\\in\\Pi_n^{0,(k+1)}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}^{0,(k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists R\\in\\Sigma_n^{0,(k+1)}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{n+1}^{0,(k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists R\\in\\Sigma_n^{0,(k+1)}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^{0,(k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{0,(k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}^{(k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{0,(k)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_n^{0,(k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{0,(k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}^{(k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{0,(k)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\Pi_n^0:=\\Pi_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\Delta_n^0:=\\Delta_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}:=\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}^{(1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_n^0:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\Pi_n^0:=\\Pi_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\Delta_n^0:=\\Delta_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}:=\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}^{(1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §13，印刷 pp.43–44 / PDF pp.52–53，以递归矩阵和交替量词前缀定义每个正层级。这里采用与之等价的按层递归表示，并显式记录元数：k 元投影的矩阵是 k+1 元关系。第 0 层作为本目录的辅助约定取所有递归关系；它不冒充原书从 n≥1 开始的编号。原有 Σ_n^0 等一元接口保留。k=0 时 N^0={()}，同一递归式仍有意义；不能将多元关系直接代入只接受 N 子集的一元 Recursive 类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"3368c1852f2a1aa0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)},\\Pi_n^{0,(k)},\\Delta_n^{0,(k)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}:=\\{R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists g\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in R\\leftrightarrow g(\\vec x)=1)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0^{0,(k)}:=\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)},\\qquad\\Pi_0^{0,(k)}:=\\mathrm{Recursive}^{(k)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{n+1}^{0,(k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists R\\in\\Pi_n^{0,(k+1)}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_{n+1}^{0,(k)}:=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\exists R\\in\\Sigma_n^{0,(k+1)}\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;(\\vec x\\in A\\leftrightarrow\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1},y\\rangle\\in R))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta_n^{0,(k)}:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)}\\cap\\Pi_n^{0,(k)},\\qquad\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}^{(k)}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\Sigma_n^{0,(k)}\\cup\\Pi_n^{0,(k)}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0:=\\Sigma_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\Pi_n^0:=\\Pi_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\Delta_n^0:=\\Delta_n^{0,(1)},\\quad\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}:=\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}^{(1)}.","display":true}],"bytes":2507,"backlinks":[{"id":"b56f83b0418112cc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"对应 §18 末段（印刷 p.71 / PDF p.80）对 §§13–14 的推广；正层级沿用 §13 的交替数前缀，实输入此时是自由变量而非实量词。层 0 是本目录的辅助约定。按 $n$ 递归定义对全部 $m,k$ 同时进行，不是关于元数 $k$ 的循环定义。$m=0$ 与 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的数关系类一致，但这里保留混合元数上标以供 §§19–20 复用。"},{"id":"69c1a70d4ab11857","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\mathrm{ArithHierarchy}$ 见 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]。$\\mathrm{Arithmetical}$ 为下式引入的一元集合谓词。"},{"id":"41bf4c1fd4079b59","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5e050274b891eb53","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7eee9c2aac09b3f2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$；编码像条款中的 $S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$。$\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$、$\\chi_G$、$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，$\\operatorname{sc}$ 见 [[68-df-sequence-code]]，$\\Sigma_n^0$ 为 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 中作用于自然数编码集合的第 $n$ 层。"},{"id":"27e776c7d53cca65","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0$ 是 [[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元层级。$n\\in\\mathbb N$，第 0 层取递归集合。"},{"id":"3a9f1c3bbe45ef77","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-53","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-arithmetical-hierarchy|df-arithmetical-hierarchy — Arithmetical Hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["3368c1852f2a1aa0","a82d826d433dcff3","7fc8baae87b873a3"]}